{
 "title": "轉生異世界的我 token 無限",
 "chapters": [
  {
   "title": "序章:睜開眼睛的地方",
   "panels": [
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p01.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "首先感受到溫度。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "臉上有一塊地方暖暖的。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p02.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那塊暖會移動，很慢，像有什麼東西在他上面晃。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p03.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "然後才是味道。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "微濕的土，這個他認得。至於在哪裡聞過的，他想不起來。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p04.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他習慣的空氣是關起來的。同一批空氣在整層樓裡繞了一整天，悶悶的，什麼味道都不帶，也哪裡都去不了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p05.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他慢慢張開眼。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p06.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他躺著。背後不是硬的，反而有點軟，是草，是土，帶著濕氣。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p07.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "然後是安靜。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "此刻靜得能聽見自己的心跳。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p08.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他就那樣靜靜地躺著，不想起來。放空了很久。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p09.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我為什麼躺在這裡？"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p10.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 31,
       "y": 10,
       "w": 45,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我沒有什麼不舒服的地方。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p11.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "胸口悶了幾年。自從接了那個案子以後就這樣。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "現在不悶了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p12.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "太陽穿過樹葉。風一吹，影子就在臉上來回地移。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p13.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "最後的印象是在公司加班。凌晨兩點，我想趴在桌上瞇一下，等一下再繼續。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "然後⋯⋯然後就到這裡了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p14.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "現在這感覺，又很像在做夢。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p15.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我不知道自己是死了，還是只是在夢裡。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "如果說是「死」，好像也太肯定了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p16.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "專案沒做完。房租繳到下個月。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "冰箱裡有一盒優格，快過期了。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 44,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "就這些。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p17.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "如果這裡是天堂，那也還好。至少不用回去上班，不用加班了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p18.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "找手機。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那些位置上什麼都沒有。連口袋都沒有。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p19.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "這身衣服不是我的。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p20.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他這才用手撐著地，把自己撐起來。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p21.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "坐起來，才看見這個世界的樣子。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p22.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "理論上，這種時候應該要驚慌。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "但那些都沒有發生。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p23.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "反正風很好。陽光也很好。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我好像自由了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p24.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "很陌生。不夠瘦，指節粗，看得出來有力氣。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p25.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我原本那雙手，七年，就磨出這麼一點。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p26.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "這種繭不是我能磨出來的。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p27.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 22,
       "y": 13,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "speech",
       "speaker": "陸修",
       "text": "⋯⋯好喔。"
      },
      {
       "x": 82,
       "y": 56,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "聲音也不是我的。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p28.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那新的規格在哪？"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "沒有半透明的視窗浮在眼前。沒有技能欄，也沒有數值。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p29.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "風吹過來，葉子動了一下。"
      },
      {
       "x": 81,
       "y": 27,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "就這樣。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p30.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 22,
       "y": 47,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "speech",
       "speaker": "陸修",
       "text": "連說明書都沒有。"
      },
      {
       "x": 33,
       "y": 8,
       "w": 50,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "看來想要一個說法，是不太可能，需要自己編了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p31.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 21,
       "y": 8,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我叫什麼？"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p32.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "陸修。這個出來得最快，一點都沒有卡。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p33.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "加班。這個最清楚。凌晨三點，整層樓只剩下我跟三排沒關的螢幕。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那個月我加了兩百個小時。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p34.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "on-call。手機在凌晨四點響的那個震動頻率，我到現在都認得。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p35.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "七年，還是五年？"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "三年，五年，七年，好像都對，也都不太對。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 44,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "明明是我自己的事。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p36.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "一間辦公室。很多人。有人在講電話。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "但我不確定那間辦公室的窗戶是靠哪一邊。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p37.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "腦子裡浮出一個標誌的形狀。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "可是名字居然想不起來。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p38.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "然後我想到母親。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我知道她煮的味噌湯偏鹹，知道她打電話來的第一句永遠是「你有沒有好好吃飯」。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p39.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "可是印象裡的母親始終背對著我。"
      },
      {
       "x": 63,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我把注意力挪過去，繞不到前面。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p40.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他就那樣在森林裡站了很久。久到肩膀開始發酸。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p41.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 15,
       "y": 11,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "speech",
       "speaker": "陸修",
       "text": "哈。"
      },
      {
       "x": 83,
       "y": 48,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "speech",
       "speaker": "陸修",
       "text": "轉生副作用吧。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p42.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 78,
       "y": 16,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "先不管它。反正也沒什麼影響。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p43.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "走了幾步，他停下來，回頭看了一眼。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p44.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 41,
       "y": 50,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那裡沒有腳印。沒有拖行的痕跡。"
      },
      {
       "x": 66,
       "y": 62,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "就好像在這一刻之前，根本沒有我這個人。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch01-p45.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 52,
       "y": 55,
       "w": 60,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "草是壓平的。形狀剛好是一個人。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "第一章:一萬字的火球",
   "panels": [
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p01.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "森林比他想的深。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他挑了太陽的方向走，走了大概兩個小時，周圍一直是同一片林子。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p02.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "肚子餓了。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我算是「轉生」，還是「穿越」？"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p03.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "從他睜開眼睛到現在，他沒有看過任何一個活物。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "安靜到他一度以為自己耳朵出了問題。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p04.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 21,
       "y": 11,
       "w": 25,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "然後，就像是專門要來反駁他，牠來了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p05.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 76,
       "y": 9,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他先聽到的是聲音。不是腳步，是呼吸。"
      },
      {
       "x": 70,
       "y": 38,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "很重、很近的呼吸，中間夾著一種從喉嚨深處壓出來的低吼。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p06.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他動了。回頭。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p07.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那是一頭野獸，他認不出是什麼。比他這輩子看過最大的狗還要大。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p08.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他背後是一棵樹。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他跑不掉。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p09.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "這種時候，主角不是都會突然覺醒什麼力量嗎。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p10.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "沒有。沒有力量覺醒，沒有系統提示。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "這個世界對他求救的反應，跟現實一模一樣：不回應。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p11.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "牠的後腿沉了下去。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他看得懂那個姿勢。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p12.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "speech",
       "speaker": "陸修",
       "text": "你不要過來啊——"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p13.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 27,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "speech",
       "speaker": "陸修",
       "text": "不要過來不要不要走開不我沒有惹你啊我什麼都沒有做啊我連飯都還沒吃——"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p14.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "牠撲了上來。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p15.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "就在牠離開地面的同一瞬間，他喊出的最後一個字落下去。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "然後前面那一整塊空間亮了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p16.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "牠在半空中被那道光擋了下來，發出一聲又尖又長的哀嚎。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p17.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "牠的眼神變了。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那頭野獸怕他。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p18.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "牠往後退，然後轉身，很快地消失在樹之間。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p19.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 23,
       "y": 10,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "森林又安靜下來。"
      },
      {
       "x": 27,
       "y": 36,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他就那樣僵在原地，過了很久才想起來要把手放下。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p20.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 9,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "呆滯許久後，他放下手。他閉上嘴。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p21.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他的喉嚨有點痛。每吞一口口水都在提醒他剛剛發生了什麼。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p22.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "但問題是，他不知道剛剛發生了什麼。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p23.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他做的第一件事不是高興，也不是害怕。是回想。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他是工程師。能重現的才叫成功，不能重現的只是運氣。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p24.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "地上的落葉被撥亂了，那是野獸剛剛落地、翻滾的地方。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p25.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 76,
       "y": 44,
       "w": 60,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "我剛剛，到底，講了什麼。"
      },
      {
       "x": 26,
       "y": 24,
       "w": 35,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他記得的不是內容。他記得的是長度。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p26.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那就先叫魔法吧。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p27.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 34,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 50,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "會不會，不是我講了什麼。"
      },
      {
       "x": 72,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "是我講了多長。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p28.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 77,
       "y": 38,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他找了塊石頭，一屁股坐下來。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p29.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他開始測試。"
      },
      {
       "x": 77,
       "y": 25,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "假設：跟內容沒有關係，只跟長度有關係。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p30.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 36,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "speech",
       "speaker": "陸修",
       "text": "差旅費請先填單，單子要主管簽，主管簽完送會計，會計那邊每個月十號截止——"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p31.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "講到「三家比價」的時候，他前面的空氣，抖了一下。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p32.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "一小簇跟剛才那道光同一種質地的東西，從地上冒了出來。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "很小。可是它在。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p33.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他盯著那一小簇光看了很久，久到它自己熄掉。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p34.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 26,
       "y": 11,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "看吧，我就說吧。"
      },
      {
       "x": 24,
       "y": 38,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "魔法不看內容。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p35.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 34,
       "y": 19,
       "w": 50,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他先固定內容，只改長度。"
      },
      {
       "x": 74,
       "y": 33,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "這一次冒出來的那簇光，比剛才那根火柴大了一圈。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p36.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 26,
       "y": 11,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他縮短。只講前三句。"
      },
      {
       "x": 78,
       "y": 27,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "這一次，什麼都沒出來。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p37.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 26,
       "y": 7,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他再拉長。光又大了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p38.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "要是那頭野獸還躲在附近，看到這一幕，大概會覺得這個人瘋了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p39.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 25,
       "y": 11,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "長度是唯一的變數。"
      },
      {
       "x": 22,
       "y": 48,
       "w": 35,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "能擋住他的，從來不是魔法本身，是他這副身體。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p40.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 26,
       "y": 10,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "站起來那一下眼前發黑，一陣頭暈。"
      },
      {
       "x": 75,
       "y": 34,
       "w": 30,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "是魔力耗盡了嗎？還是貧血？"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p41.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "空地的盡頭是一整片更密的林子，樹跟樹之間黑黑的。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p42.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "如果魔法真的沒有盡頭⋯⋯"
      },
      {
       "x": 79,
       "y": 42,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "thought",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那他到底能用說的放出多大的魔法？"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p43.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他吞了一口口水。喉嚨還是痛的。"
      },
      {
       "x": 27,
       "y": 38,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他站直了身體，面對那片林子，深深吸了一口氣。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p44.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "然後他開口了。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p45.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "speech",
       "speaker": "陸修",
       "text": "差旅費請先填單，單子要主管簽——"
      },
      {
       "x": 27,
       "y": 53,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他決定講的，還是報帳流程。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p46.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 25,
       "y": 13,
       "w": 30,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他前面的空氣開始積東西。"
      },
      {
       "x": 25,
       "y": 30,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那些字沒有散掉，一個字接一個字。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p47.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 74,
       "y": 77,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他學會了在句子跟句子的縫隙裡偷氣，像游泳一樣。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p48.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "那片林子前面的空氣，開始扭曲。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "好像那裡等一下會有很重的東西落下來，周圍先讓開、騰出了位置。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p49.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他沒有停。"
      },
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 28,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "這一次他要講到底，一個字都不留。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p50.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 27,
       "y": 10,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "他把報帳流程講完了。整整一遍，一個環節都沒漏。"
      },
      {
       "x": 26,
       "y": 32,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "然後那條線繃到底。"
      }
     ],
     "effects": []
    },
    {
     "image": "imgs/ch02-p51.webp",
     "bubbles": [
      {
       "x": 28,
       "y": 12,
       "w": 40,
       "type": "narration",
       "speaker": "",
       "text": "這一次火沒有從地上長出來。它是直接出現的，一整片。"
